sitioning"},{"type":"p","text":"For B.Sc Physics → Scientist Trainee (ISRO/DRDO/BARC), the most effective strategy is:"},{"type":"p","text":"Do not position yourself as only a B.Sc Physics graduate. Position yourself as a Physics + Scientific Computing + Research candidate."},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest long-term combination is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Sc Physics","M.Sc Physics/Applied Physics","Research/Scientist Recruitment","Specialized R&D","Senior Scientist"]},{"type":"p","text":"with Python, numerical methods, experimental skills, data analysis and AI-assisted scientific computing layered onto the physics foundation."}]}]}